{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/43094954/70776c395322efe5baa4fcc587f0711e3414b2c1.png
Let's see what awaits us: 

Event:

- until and including May 16, the experience gained for completed battle pass quests is doubled.

Game world:


 the map has been visually improved;
 changed the location of the shrines, which were close to the border areas;
 new objects were added to the map.


Character Changes:

Finn:


 increased the cooldown time of the "Second Blink Shade" ability from the "Double Lift" perk from 20/14/6 to 20/14/8 sec;
 decreased duration of immobilization from "Trick Shade" perk from 0.5/0.9/1.2 sec. to 0.5/0.75/1 sec;
 increased dodge interval of “Smooth Operator” perk from 6/4.5/3 to 8/6/4.5 sec;
 decreased Invisibility time from “Bushwacker” perk from 1/1.5/3 to 1/1.5/2 sec;
 increased Health and Shields regeneration from "Hit and Run" perk from 6/9/13 to 8/10/13.


Danila:


 reduced the minimum interval between the drop of supplies from the “Supply Drop” perk from 3 to 1.5 sec;
 changed "Hazard Adaptation" perk;

1) Now all perk bonuses are given to all allies on the map; 
2) Damage reduction from mobs now also applies to damage from Snowstorm and enemy shrines;
3) Damage reduction increased from -10/-20/-30% to -15/-30/-45%.

Valkyrie:

- defensive dome ability changes :
1) Dome action time is fixed at 8 sec.
2) Standard toughness increased.
3) Durability no longer decreases with dome lifetime.

 increased additional dome strength from Valkyrie “Shield maiden perk on 3rd level from 3000 to 4000;
 decreased delay before shields regeneration from "Fortification" perk from 4 to 2.75 sec;
 ascension ability "First aid training" now also increases shield recovery efficiency.


Artifact Changes:

Shadowmancer:


 invisibility is imposed 0.5 sec after using the ability;
 the effect is now triggered by the abilities of all weapons in the game.


Fixes:


 fixed incorrect display of seekers armor in their stats in the main menu;
 removed the parameter "recoil" from the characteristics of weapons in the main menu;
 fixed incorrect display of some skins on weapons that lie on the ground;
 fixed rarity mismatches for some weapon and character skins;
 fixed a bug that caused mobs to think a djinn was a live player.


Interface Changes:


 many localization adjustments have been made;
 fixed errors that led to a shift in the position of the text;
 temporarily disabled the functionality of the invitation to the group of players from recent matches.


Time to dominate the map!

Let's take a look at what's in store for us: 

- 'Ascension' will become available to all players;
- the system of calculating life after knockdown is redesigned, now there will be no shields in knockdown;
- alternate attack mechanics "Earthquake" and "Flak Cannon" are redesigned. Flight time is now independent of movement speed;
- bots are smarter now, they won't die in djinn mode during first stages of zone;
stan effect rewritten, stan is now called "Root", characters under this effect can't move and move with abilities;
- if your character is "lightened" this will now be indicated by an icon next to the life of the character.

Bugfixes:

- corrected the place counting in the match;
- you can now shoot up close to a wall;
- fixed crashes in the lobby;
- altars and obelisks freeze again when hit by a snowstorm;
- fixed a bug that caused the game client to crash due to movement speed dropping to zero;
- corrected incorrect display of the ability recharge icon when visually the ability went to recharge, but the timer was not displayed.

Interface:

- fixed a quantity of errors in translation;
- revised the game map: added missing building silhouettes; corrected incorrect silhouettes;
- redesigned Danila's supplies.

Dominance is waiting!
